        },
        {
          "text": "The MongoDB 8.0 self-managed guide defines `cacheSizeGB` as the WiredTiger internal-cache budget and describes filesystem caching separately. It warns that container RAM can be lower than host RAM and that the internal cache might not account for a specific container limit; it points to `hostInfo` for the memory limit. These storage-cache budgets are separate from the per-CPU and total-thread allocator cache controls. The separate documented consumers do not establish a total process-memory ceiling. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/configuration-options.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:79c152e3318793b85daf96bbc76a7d54ff76b92bcd108b3d47b1258ef8fc5405",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:68630c4462aee06d39ee8aec0b553326ffbcf451a7e514408870077cc34589ca",
            "ev:99798cb61b39ee999eef4192bc9e263c67f49a87e75a820a6d849d898348629a",
            "ev:a0c75fe063509f9bb45d266b3b54676f925299aea6e7e511aed9fdf658eb7b75",
            "ev:efbb2a0f3bbe615b8d388c83a05e90940304a71e114ab5f879994ede5dd13f70",
            "ev:f964f34daeab447d5cc8c9d5958a866152fac1f128d4a05f1621d62f3cf9dab3"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://github.com/google/tcmalloc/blob/master/docs/tuning.md",
            "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/r8.0.16/src/mongo/util/tcmalloc_set_parameter.cpp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the inspected MongoDB 8.0.16 `getMongoMaxCpuCacheSize` function, `atoll` parses the environment override and `value != 0` is its only value check before returning to an `unsigned long long` result. A parsed zero falls through to the memory-derived default; the branch does not require a positive value and has no explicit range, complete-string or conversion-error check. A negative parsed value therefore also satisfies that nonzero test. The absence of validation supplies no safe cache-size input contract for negative, malformed or overflowing text, and no particular malformed-input, overflow or platform-width outcome is established by these checks. This environment branch is distinct from the validated BSON and string server-parameter entry points. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/r8.0.16/src/third_party/tcmalloc/dist/tcmalloc/cpu_cache.cc",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:6d0ac1ae380f65857b57ef675c4e7e6538afcbd10ee33fd3f16bf2737c09869f",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
