    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Upstream TCMalloc documents heterogeneous per-CPU caches that redistribute capacity from lightly used caches to heavily used caches. A heavily used cache may grow beyond `tcmalloc_max_per_cpu_cache_size`; this is an upstream tuning boundary, rather than proof that every MongoDB build enables that optimization. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://github.com/google/tcmalloc/blob/master/docs/tuning.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a1b1627f1c284623bb30add2469a680c6c02025204d32aee244ce22fe5b6de2b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:68630c4462aee06d39ee8aec0b553326ffbcf451a7e514408870077cc34589ca"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the selected MongoDB 8.0.16 Linux source, cache activation obtains `num_cpus` from `NumCPUs` and passes it to `getMongoMaxCpuCacheSize` only under the guard `max_cache_size == kMaxCpuCacheSize`. `NumCPUs` caches `NumPossibleCPUsNoCache`, which reads `/sys/devices/system/cpu/possible` and returns the highest listed CPU identifier plus one. The header describes possible CPUs including offline CPUs. That inspected path uses the possible-CPU view rather than reading an affinity mask or CPU quota. Actual container file views, effective constraints and workload-appropriate cache capacity remain deployment questions. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/6649991c993da79c269e52beec51274bf53fbb98/src/third_party/tcmalloc/dist/tcmalloc/cpu_cache.h",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:87da424573d4fb3457ee0687e2f047224cf92f73fc19a340e5a141fb29e71340",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:44e9524ed220e7ac6db30af5c5e98c5e11d39be535ae7eac89da853fda16c39f",
            "ev:4f08faabff156edf5f4f4a78d28270a63af6bf7d9eefa6150373c8c538e3097b",
            "ev:5b0f5e5e72d2031cfd915f0aca34fab4218f6f4f9e8f98ebc805c92f9c0b0148",
            "ev:6f6056cfbbfe582f66c29ed52686a0b7ea58b1c8e3d9925b2e30a8ecf9594132",
            "ev:8cf5b40dd26a0028c1eddf403298935d2eadf97191affeda9e632e39dcdb1404"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/6649991c993da79c269e52beec51274bf53fbb98/src/third_party/tcmalloc/dist/tcmalloc/internal/sysinfo.h",
            "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/6649991c993da79c269e52beec51274bf53fbb98/src/third_party/tcmalloc/dist/tcmalloc/internal/sysinfo.cc",
            "https://api.github.com/repos/mongodb/mongo/git/tags/9cc9fb2fa826b5454ccb41773d462b2233a0734f",
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/release-notes/8.0-changelog.md"
          ]
